   "textLength": 578,
   "text": "Pump Up Your Playlist With the Right Pair of Headphones\nHeadphones that pinch or make your favourite tracks sound flat? No thanks. The right pair should feel good from the first wear, whether you’re taking calls or zoning in on a podcast.\nJB’s massive range of headphones delivers exactly that. Since 1974, we’ve been turning up the tech for Australia, and audio has always been part of our DNA. As t",
