  {
   "index": 26,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 214,
   "text": "JB is where Aussies go for headphones because we know sound and we know tech, so finding your next pair is easy. Our huge headphones range is backed by 50+ years of retail know-how, plus over 205 stores nationwide.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
