  },
  {
   "index": 27,
   "tag": "ul",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 865,
   "text": "A name built on sound. JB started with Hi-Fi and recorded music, so audio has always been part of our story.\nShop headphones your way. Head online, visit your local JB or use Click-and-Collect to lock in your next pair. We deliver Australia-wide.\nCompare more in one place. JB’s headphones collection brings different fits and listening needs together. Line up what matters without jumping between si",
