    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 29,
   "tag": "div",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 662,
   "text": "Go wired for sound-per-dollar and zero lag, Bluetooth headphones for freedom and true wireless earbuds for that total cord-free feel.\nWired headphones keep things simple in the best way. Plug in and play, with no charging routine and a steady connection every time. Prefer something pocket-sized? Corded earphones give you that same plug-in reliability in a smaller, in-canal fit.\nWireless headphones",
   "counts": {
