   }
  },
  {
   "index": 32,
   "tag": "ul",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 1139,
   "text": "For the commute and everyday listening? Go for in-ear headphones for something compact that fits easily into your day. The in-canal fit helps with noise isolating by creating a passive seal so your playlist or podcast stays front and centre.\nFor the gym and the outdoors? Pick sports headphones when you want a pair made to keep up with you. Want your music going without closing off the world? Open-",
