   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 211,
   "text": "Got a young music fan, movie lover or gamer at home? JB’s range also includes kids headphones made for smaller ears. They’re a handy pick for schoolwork, gaming, travel and downtime without feeling too grown-up.",
