   "tag": "div×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 1271,
   "text": "Are Noise-Cancelling Headphones Worth It?\nYes, noise-cancelling headphones are worth it if commutes or open offices are part of your daily life. Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) uses tiny microphones to detect outside sound, then fires back an opposite sound wave to help cancel it out. The result? Less background buzz, more of what you actually want to hear.\nYou’ll find ANC tech in over-ear favouri",
